{
    "title": "Flirtini - Chat, Flirt, Date",
    "description": "Looking to easily meet friends or find dates? Want to chat and meet girls or guys in your local area for fun and exciting dates? Welcome to Flirtini, the ultimate online dating app with a twist of AI!\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f Warning! Extremely flirty vibes \ud83d\ude09\r\n\r\nDive into the world of dating and anonymous texting with this social network! The Flirtini community invites you to engage in private chats, meet singles, and enjoy a rewarding relationship journey. Just ask AI, stay relaxed, chat, flirt, and maybe even fall in love! \ud83d\udc96\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9e UNIQUE FEATURES \r\n\u2022 ChatGPT: Generate a personalized profile description in seconds with the power of OpenAI. As one of the most popular AI chats in the world, ChatGPT creates a description based on your personality, appearance and preferences, making a great first impression effortless. \r\n\u2022 Personal AI Assistant: Discover your ultimate dating companion. Our AI Assistant provides timely advice without taking control, ensuring your dating experience remains authentically human. It's like having a savvy wingman in your pocket, guiding your dating journey. \r\n\u2022 Icebreaker: Our AI-assistant helps you conquer anonymous chats, ensuring you never run out of things to say. Enjoy a smooth flowing conversation with tailored ice-breakers that are sure to grab attention. \r\n\u2022 Flirty Mate: Our AI isn't just a companion, it's your key to sparking flirty banter and irresistible wordplay. Enjoy lively local chats, playful teasing, and even virtual dates, all with a splash of flirtatious charm. \r\n\u2022 Custom Chat Theme: Add a touch of personality with our Custom Chat Theme feature! Make each chat distinctively yours with individual themes. It's like having unique wallpaper for every conversation!\r\n\u2022 Gift Story Boost: Make a statement and kickstart a conversation with our Gift Story Boost feature. Boosting someone's story becomes a unique gift, sparking immediate interest and paving the way for meaningful connections.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51 PREMIUM FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Beauty Filters: Use our in-app camera filters to perfect your pictures. Correct skin tone, add makeup, remove defects, and more. Enhance your photos before sharing them with other users. \r\n\u2022 Disguise Settings: Your privacy is our priority. With our Secret Message App feature, enjoy anonymous and private chats while keeping your conversations secure. Additionally, protect your login with a passcode, fingerprint or Face ID, and customize push notifications to stay anonymous. We even prevent screen captures and recording.\r\n\r\nFlirtini prioritizes your convenience, offering: \r\n\u2022 Live Support: Our customer care team is available 24/7. Call or text us anytime for help. \r\n\u2022 Strict Security: We verify every member to ensure a safe experience. Meet and chat with strangers without worrying about fakes or scammers.\r\n\r\nWith Flirtini, meeting new friends or potential partners for casual dating has never been easier. Whether you live in New York, Miami, or Los Angeles, you can find the perfect date with just a few taps. Flirtini is not your average dating site - it's where you meet up, find singles, and experience the thrill of dating!\r\n\r\nNow is the perfect time to find the right partner, so why wait? Start your magical journey today! \ud83d\udc9c\r\n\r\nAuto-renewable subscription info:\r\nThere is a limit of one free Trial Membership per Google Play account. Payment will be charged to your Google Play account in 3 days after you start using your free Trial Membership. The subscription price varies by country and may change without notice. But you could always see the exact price shown in the app. Flirtini subscription will be automatically renewed in case you did not deactivate the automatic recharge a minimum of 24 hours prior to your current subscription period end. You may cancel the subscription anytime.\r\nPlease read our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use for more information:\r\nhttps://www.flirtini.com/staticPage/privacypolicy\r\nhttps://www.flirtini.com/staticPage/terms",
